              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Kym Cox Surridge"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This was tasty and not nearly as garlicky as I thought it would be. I used blue cheese because I had it on hand, but next time I'll use the feta and add some oregano, as well as more onions. I used raw, shredded beets, and I added red wine vinegar to pump up the flavor a bit.",
